  "id": "animal-model",
  "term": "animal model",
  "definition": "An animal model is the use of animals in an experimental setup to try to reproduce features of a human disorder. It is intended as a research tool for studying the disorder’s underlying mechanisms, although a given procedure may or may not successfully produce the expected condition or symptoms.",
